Apple today released new watchOS 27.2.1 and visionOS 27.2.1 updates, with the software coming two weeks after the launch of watchOS 27.2 and visionOS 27.2.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/06/watchos-27.jpg" alt="" width="1319" height="742" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1051912" /><br/>
According to Apple's release notes, the watchOS update includes security fixes, while the visionOS 27.2.1 update includes security updates and bug fixes.<br/>
<br/>
The new software can be installed using the Settings app on each device. <br/>
